SUMMARY:[Machine Learning][Deep Representation Learning] NeurIPS 2026 - Abs
 tract submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Conference on Neural Information Processing S
 ystems\nWebsite: https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026\nSource URL: https:/
 /neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/Dates\nLocation: Sydney\, Australia\nTopics:
  Machine Learning\, Deep Representation Learning\, Time Series & Sequenti
 al Data\, Explainability & Interpretability\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: 
 Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nNotes:
  Official NeurIPS 2026 pages (checked 2026-10-28) list Sydney as the main
  site\, Dec 6-12\, with Atlanta and Paris satellite sites Dec 9-13\, and 
 the May 4 abstract/May 6 paper deadlines (AoE). Paper submissions are clo
 sed\; no extension was published.\nScope: Broad research in machine learn
 ing\, especially deep and generative models\, statistical foundations\, o
 ptimization\, probabilistic inference\, and learning for decision-making.
  Language\, vision\, and scalable ML systems are important research commu
 nities. Interdisciplinary applications should contribute insight of wider
  interest to the machine-learning community.\nAdditional topics: Learning
  Theory & Statistical Foundations\, Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty 
 ML\, Reinforcement Learning\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, Comput
 er Vision & Pattern Recognition\, ML Systems & Infrastructure\nScope sour
 ces (2026): https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/CallForPapers\nScope last
  checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/Dates
END:VEVENT
